#### Deploy a Gateway Controller
The Gateway API doesn’t come with a built-in controller. You can use an existing one like Istio, Kong, or Envoy Gateway. 

Install the Istio Gateway Controller

istioctl install --set profile=default 
kubectl apply -f https://github.com/istio/istio/releases/latest/download/gateway.yaml

